WEBVTT

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:03.640
Everyone, Kaleido Star is about to start.

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:06.680
When you watch Kaleido Star,
please keep your room brightly lit,

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:09.540
and sit as far from the TV as you can, okay?

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:14.180
Well, everyone, it's May.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:17.920
I was so depressed because I failed last time,
and I was moping about it all by myself.

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:22.690
But I realized something
after Meryl talked to me.

00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:26.700
I've just been looking for excuses,
blaming things on somebody else.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:30.800
My name is May Wong,
an athlete who never gives up.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:32.530
I will not let anybody get in my way.

00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:37.730
Sora, you're not the only one trying to get
to the place where Miss Layla is!

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:48.050
<i>Tattoo Kiss, the beginning is
red and black passions</i>

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:48.050
<i>Tattoo Kiss hajimari wa aka to kuro no Passion</i>

00:00:48.050 --> 00:00:55.360
<i>Sometimes, we rely on our contrary hearts</i>

00:00:48.050 --> 00:00:55.360
<i>Toki ni urahara na kokoro o tayori ni</i>

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:56.460
<i>Tattoo Kiss, the last resort is a
mission which changes the future</i>

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:56.460
<i>Tattoo Kiss kirifuda wa mirai o kaeru Mission</i>

00:00:56.460 --> 00:01:02.120
<i>Tattoo Kiss, the last resort is a
mission which changes the future</i>

00:00:56.460 --> 00:01:02.120
<i>Tattoo Kiss kirifuda wa mirai o kaeru Mission</i>

00:00:56.460 --> 00:01:02.120
New Wings

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:10.070
<i>There is no place for ambiguous answers in love</i>

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:10.070
<i>Koi ni aimai na kotae wa iranai</i>

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:17.550
<i>Even while pretending not to see the
impossible reality, we bet</i>

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:17.550
<i>Arienai genjitsu minai furi shite mo Bet</i>

00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:23.810
<i>Hard to obtain truth. Can you feel me now?</i>

00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:23.810
<i>Egatai shinjitsu Can U feel me now?</i>

00:01:23.990 --> 00:01:28.360
<i>Say what to myself who gets excited easily?</i>

00:01:23.990 --> 00:01:28.360
<i>Nesshiyasui jibun ni Say What?</i>

00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:31.720
<i>I'm confused, what to say</i>

00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:31.720
<i>Tomadou iibun</i>

00:01:33.330 --> 00:01:40.940
<i>Dreamin' the never-waking dream,
the falling fate</i>

00:01:33.330 --> 00:01:40.940
<i>Dreamin' samenai yume ochiteku sadame</i>

00:01:40.940 --> 00:01:46.700
<i>Don't stop lovin' can't stop lovin' you
Ya ya ya</i>

00:01:40.940 --> 00:01:46.700
<i>Don't stop lovin' Can't stop lovin' U
Ya ya ya</i>

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:56.050
<i>I believe in you even if I lose everything for it</i>

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:56.050
<i>Believe in U hikikae ni subete ushinatte mo</i>

00:01:56.050 --> 00:02:01.580
<i>Still lovin' can't stop lovin' you
No no no</i>

00:01:56.050 --> 00:02:01.580
<i>Still lovin' can't stop lovin' U
No no no</i>

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:08.190
<i>Tattoo Kiss</i>

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:08.190
<i>Tattoo Kiss</i>

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:14.600
Congratulations!

00:02:15.340 --> 00:02:16.610
Thank you...

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:19.070
But I wonder if this is okay?

00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:20.280
I think it's okay.

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:21.040
Really?

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:23.250
Leon said you passed, after all.

00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:25.480
It means he's acknowledged you.

00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:26.580
I wonder...

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:27.920
He did, he did.

00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:30.120
Congratulations for being able
to participate in the festival.

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:31.950
Sora, good luck.

00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:34.290
Thanks. I'll do my best.

00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:38.360
Are you concerned about May?

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:43.830
Because I'm useless...

00:02:47.340 --> 00:02:49.000
I understand how you feel,

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:51.410
but just think about the festival for right now.

00:02:51.410 --> 00:02:53.610
He's right, Sora. Your goal is...

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:54.740
Okay, say it with me, everybody:

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:56.610
Victory!

00:02:57.380 --> 00:02:59.580
Yeah, that's right.

00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:03.150
Only one of us is able to
participate in the festival.

00:03:03.150 --> 00:03:07.350
So, in order for me to participate
in the festival, I have to beat May.

00:03:07.890 --> 00:03:09.890
Yes, yes, yes.

00:03:09.890 --> 00:03:11.760
Hello.

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:14.060
Oh, Kalos.

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:16.660
What? Sora's here, but...

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:20.700
What?! The final test?

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:21.930
What?!

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:25.000
The final test?

00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:30.980
The Two Amazing Demons

00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:30.980
"The Two Amazing Demons"

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:33.910
The Two Amazing Demons

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:37.790
I'll have them prepare
for the final test right away.

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:42.590
Certainly, if she is going to participate in
the festival, she can't sidestep this test.

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:48.060
But if she missteps once,
her career on the stage may end.

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:52.430
Sora can pull through this. I believe that.

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:00.600
The final test...

00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:05.440
If I can pass this, that
Phoenix Ticket will be mine.

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:11.450
I mustn't think about May.

00:04:15.660 --> 00:04:17.190
It makes me nervous.

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:19.030
I wonder what kind of test it is?

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:21.500
No matter what kind of test it is,
she'll be okey-dokey.

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:23.490
Everyone is cheering you.

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:26.730
Thank you. I will do my best.

00:04:30.310 --> 00:04:31.840
Miss Layla...

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:34.840
Sora, I will ask you one more time.

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:39.840
Do you seriously want to participate in the
Circus Festival no matter what happens?

00:04:41.150 --> 00:04:42.550
Yes!

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.490
I see. That's fine, then.

00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:48.090
Please do your best.

00:04:48.090 --> 00:04:50.150
Yes, I will.

00:04:50.630 --> 00:04:53.030
I have to pass this test.

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:55.160
No matter how difficult the
maneuver is, I have to.

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:57.690
I have no other alternative.

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:01.470
I'm ready.

00:05:01.470 --> 00:05:02.960
Climb up.

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:13.450
What do you want me to do?

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:15.420
Let's see.

00:05:15.420 --> 00:05:18.020
I want you to do a layout somersault.

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:18.850
What?

00:05:18.850 --> 00:05:19.490
What did he say?

00:05:19.490 --> 00:05:20.160
What is this about?

00:05:19.490 --> 00:05:20.160
What did he say?

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:20.850
What is this about?

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:23.860
What's a layout somersault?

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:26.800
Among the trapeze maneuvers, that's
the most basic among of all the basics.

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:30.420
The performer spins once, and
grabs the catcher's hands.

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:33.100
That's it?

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:34.860
That's right.

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:38.070
All right.

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:39.770
Wait.

00:05:40.180 --> 00:05:41.940
Remove the safety net.

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.110
WHAT?!

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:45.640
No way! You can't!

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:49.680
When you perform in the festival,

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:51.850
you have neither a safety net nor a lifeline.

00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:54.290
That's true, but...

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:57.890
A maneuver as basic as this
should not require a net.

00:05:57.890 --> 00:06:00.220
I will create a chance for you to show off.

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:04.670
That's what he said to May.

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:07.170
I will create a chance for you to show off.

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:11.370
I will create a perfect chance for you
to show off in today's show.

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:19.010
Will you fail the final test before you take it?

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:22.650
Please remove the net.

00:06:24.490 --> 00:06:25.980
Hurry.

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:28.350
Yes.

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:31.030
A good attitude, Sora.

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:35.090
Show me how ready you are to be a real star.

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:50.500
Let's begin.

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:08.560
I'll jump next time.

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:10.730
Sora...

00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:17.610
Jump like you mean it.

00:07:17.610 --> 00:07:19.700
Hesitating can be dangerous, Sora.

00:07:22.180 --> 00:07:24.480
It's perfect timing. I can do this!

00:07:32.150 --> 00:07:34.120
I can't jump.

00:07:35.960 --> 00:07:37.250
Sora!

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:39.890
I can't believe this.

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:44.970
When I thought of what I'd do
if he doesn't catch me...

00:07:44.970 --> 00:07:47.060
I couldn't jump.

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:57.680
Please let me try one more time.

00:07:58.510 --> 00:07:59.980
When you do it for real in the festival,

00:07:59.980 --> 00:08:02.070
are you going to ask me to do it
one more time too?

00:08:03.050 --> 00:08:05.120
But... Please let me try one more...

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:06.280
Sora!

00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:08.720
It's unseemly.

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:16.550
Sorry.

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:25.640
The way it is now, we'll have no
participants in this year's festival.

00:08:25.640 --> 00:08:26.840
I know.

00:08:26.840 --> 00:08:30.210
I thought Leon Oswald must have wanted
to participate in the festival

00:08:30.210 --> 00:08:33.080
in order to wipe out his shame
from three years ago.

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:34.880
But, it seems I was wrong.

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:37.350
What is his purpose in staying here?

00:08:37.350 --> 00:08:42.120
I heard the rumor that he was looking for
a partner who can match his level.

00:08:43.190 --> 00:08:48.330
But all the partners he had
in the past left the stage.

00:08:48.330 --> 00:08:51.700
Because he treats them all
like he did May Wong.

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:54.870
But, if they can leave the stage
over something like that,

00:08:54.870 --> 00:08:58.900
I think they'd be better off if they
quit and found another career.

00:08:59.710 --> 00:09:02.280
Knowing that, and he still invited Sora.

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:05.650
It means Leon must have thought
that Sora could be his partner.

00:09:05.650 --> 00:09:08.740
And he thought he could win in the festival.

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:14.320
Even now, Sora is still trying to
follow your footsteps.

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:17.560
In order for her to surpass Layla Hamilton,

00:09:17.560 --> 00:09:19.790
she has no other choice but to
win in the festival.

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:22.760
I think that's the starting line.

00:09:22.760 --> 00:09:25.700
So you haven't given up on your wish yet.

00:09:25.700 --> 00:09:29.340
That's right, you're the one who was
first attracted to Sora's potential

00:09:29.340 --> 00:09:31.640
and pressured her into appearing on stage.

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:34.810
I will do anything if I can make money.

00:09:34.810 --> 00:09:37.210
Kalos, if you were capable of that,

00:09:37.210 --> 00:09:39.680
Kaleido Stage would never wind up in a pinch.

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:44.220
That was meant as a compliment.

00:09:45.120 --> 00:09:47.720
I wonder if Sora is all right.

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:49.320
It's impossible to do something like that.

00:09:49.320 --> 00:09:51.630
Especially, after she saw what happened to May.

00:09:51.630 --> 00:09:54.400
I think we should leave her alone right now.

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:55.860
Okay.

00:09:58.130 --> 00:10:00.600
I even endured that special training.

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:03.040
I wasted everything.

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:06.070
I disappointed Miss Layla.

00:10:06.070 --> 00:10:07.940
Sora, you're so stupid.

00:10:07.940 --> 00:10:12.810
But I don't have the confidence
to pair with Mr. Leon.

00:10:12.810 --> 00:10:15.370
What should I do?

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:21.420
You were able to perform even the
legendary great maneuver with Layla.

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:24.360
To think that you can't even do
a basic maneuver with Leon...

00:10:24.360 --> 00:10:29.600
I can't trust Leon.

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:34.760
A real star doesn't change her shine
depending on who's there.

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:40.170
Are you saying that I can't be a real star?

00:10:40.170 --> 00:10:42.480
I don't know.

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:45.510
But I know for sure that being a real star
is something very distant for you

00:10:45.510 --> 00:10:47.380
because of the way you're acting right now.

00:10:48.850 --> 00:10:50.920
It's far...

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:52.320
It's far, isn't it?

00:10:52.320 --> 00:10:54.620
It is endlessly far away.

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:57.630
Sora!

00:10:57.630 --> 00:10:58.860
Yes.

00:10:58.860 --> 00:11:00.730
This is bad!

00:11:00.730 --> 00:11:04.100
It seems that May hasn't been in her
room since before last night.

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:06.620
What? May?

00:11:18.850 --> 00:11:19.750
Sorry, sorry...

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:21.740
Get the ball, Sis!

00:11:23.250 --> 00:11:24.690
Hurry, hurry!

00:11:24.690 --> 00:11:26.120
Pass, pass!

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:31.090
Watch what you're doing.

00:11:32.390 --> 00:11:34.120
Okay...

00:11:34.930 --> 00:11:37.130
She looks kinda depressed, huh?

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:38.720
Yeah.

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:03.860
Meryl...

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:05.790
As I thought, you're here.

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:07.260
I found her.

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:10.470
Sora...

00:12:10.470 --> 00:12:12.900
Why did you come here?

00:12:12.900 --> 00:12:14.600
Did you come here to laugh at me?

00:12:15.270 --> 00:12:18.570
No... May, I have something I want
to talk to you about...

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:21.980
Stop it! What could you have to say to me now?!

00:12:21.980 --> 00:12:25.480
Leon chose you. You won.

00:12:25.480 --> 00:12:27.820
Be more proud of your victory.

00:12:27.820 --> 00:12:29.680
And laugh at me, the one who lost!

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:31.720
May, I won't laugh at...

00:12:31.720 --> 00:12:34.090
That's the thing about you that makes me sick!

00:12:34.090 --> 00:12:37.260
As a newcomer, I picked a fight
with you, the top star,

00:12:37.260 --> 00:12:38.690
and just when I was feeling like hot stuff,

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:40.500
thinking I grabbed away the
lead role away from you,

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:44.800
in the end I wasn't seen as anything
but a tool to train you...

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:52.800
He injured my shoulder, and I ran away.
Isn't that funny? Laugh at me.

00:12:53.740 --> 00:12:58.410
Laugh at me... at least.
No way do I want your sympathy!

00:12:58.410 --> 00:13:04.450
No, you're wrong, May.
I couldn't pass Leon's final test.

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:07.960
I'm afraid of Leon.

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:11.890
I was afraid of him, and I couldn't
release my hands from the swing.

00:13:12.260 --> 00:13:16.060
What? Then, the partner has not...

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:18.260
No. It hasn't been decided yet.

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:29.780
You didn't come back to the dormitory,
so you didn't know what happened.

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:32.910
So, I thought I had to tell you this.

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:36.920
Even though you told me, what I can do?

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:39.190
That is... I don't know.

00:13:39.190 --> 00:13:42.760
But, I don't know what I should do either.

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:47.350
So, what I want to say is... well, I'm not sure...

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:50.830
When did you get something like that?

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:53.830
You guys are so hesitant!
You're irritating me so much.

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:54.800
Sora!

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:55.540
Yes.

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:59.540
Did you come all the way here to find May
and tell her something like that?

00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:00.910
Well... kind of...

00:14:00.910 --> 00:14:01.680
May!

00:14:01.680 --> 00:14:02.510
What?

00:14:02.510 --> 00:14:05.410
When did you start giving up so easily?

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:07.210
I'm...

00:14:07.210 --> 00:14:11.550
If you act like that, you should have listened
to what I said, and kept skating!

00:14:12.390 --> 00:14:16.390
You can't do anything?
You don't know what to do?

00:14:16.390 --> 00:14:20.490
To me, it looks like you just
don't want to do it.

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:25.370
You say something like that, but
I was abandoned by Leon!

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:26.800
You're wrong.

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:30.840
You were injured because you
didn't have the skills.

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:34.710
To think you can't handle a little ad lib like that.

00:14:34.710 --> 00:14:38.580
If you want to blame something,
blame your lack of skills.

00:14:39.150 --> 00:14:41.220
Don't act like you're the victim.

00:14:41.220 --> 00:14:43.020
The one who abandoned you is you, May!

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:44.420
Yourself!

00:14:45.390 --> 00:14:47.190
The May I remember is:

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:49.690
when someone told you "no,"
you used to work so hard

00:14:49.690 --> 00:14:52.280
so that the person would never
be able to say "no" to you again.

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:58.520
You never said you couldn't do
something, no matter what!

00:14:58.630 --> 00:14:59.360
Ow!

00:14:59.530 --> 00:15:01.570
Don't talk to my sis like that!

00:15:01.570 --> 00:15:02.700
Sis?

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:04.410
Dammit! You dumb kids!

00:15:04.410 --> 00:15:06.810
Come and get us!

00:15:08.610 --> 00:15:11.130
Nyah, nyah, nyah, nyah, nyah, nyah, nyah!

00:15:22.760 --> 00:15:24.160
Yeah! Yeah!

00:15:24.160 --> 00:15:26.020
Oh, I know.

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:30.500
I may still have a chance too.

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:31.800
May...

00:15:34.170 --> 00:15:35.740
Thank you, Meryl.

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:39.240
I remembered how bad I am at giving up.

00:15:39.240 --> 00:15:42.270
I'll challenge Leon one more time.

00:15:43.180 --> 00:15:45.050
It sounds like you've gotten motivated.

00:15:45.050 --> 00:15:48.980
Yes. I also have to thank you too, Sora.

00:15:48.980 --> 00:15:52.090
Thank you for taking the time and
coming all the way down here

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:53.250
to let me know that you were disqualified.

00:15:53.250 --> 00:15:57.160
I'll be his REAL partner this time.

00:15:57.160 --> 00:15:58.930
Aren't you afraid of him?

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:00.630
As if!

00:16:00.630 --> 00:16:02.500
Once he sees my new maneuver,

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:05.130
I'm sure Leon will grab my hands this time.

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:09.240
And with that maneuver, I'm going
to participate in the festival!

00:16:09.240 --> 00:16:13.170
I'll make the world acknowledge me
like they did Miss Layla!

00:16:13.440 --> 00:16:15.080
A new maneuver...

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:16.480
That's right.

00:16:16.480 --> 00:16:20.410
And that name is: Demon Spiral!

00:16:20.720 --> 00:16:24.050
Demon Spiral... What kind of maneuver is that?

00:16:24.050 --> 00:16:26.710
Obviously I don't know yet.

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:30.520
As for the practice room, I'm going to use it.

00:16:31.030 --> 00:16:34.260
Guys, I'm going back to the dormitory again.

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:36.360
So, can you tell that to Mom and Dad?

00:16:36.360 --> 00:16:37.360
Yes!

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:39.590
She's gone back to the sis we know!

00:16:39.670 --> 00:16:42.640
Really, she's such trouble.

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:45.400
Well, Sora, what are you going to do?

00:16:46.340 --> 00:16:48.840
Will you just stand there and watch her?

00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:51.150
No, I don't want to. But...

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:53.780
Did you say you can't trust your partner?

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:54.850
Yes.

00:16:54.850 --> 00:16:57.050
You're the same as May.

00:16:57.050 --> 00:16:59.750
You're blaming your lack of skill on your partner.

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:02.790
Before you say this and that
about your partner,

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:06.250
are you doing enough to
earn your partner's trust?

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:11.900
You can't be my partner the way you are now.

00:17:11.900 --> 00:17:14.300
I'll reduce your part further tomorrow.

00:17:14.570 --> 00:17:16.370
Instead of worrying about that,

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:19.240
improve your skills so that you're
good enough to satisfy me.

00:17:19.570 --> 00:17:21.340
That is important,

00:17:21.340 --> 00:17:23.830
but I think the Kids' Stage is important too.

00:17:25.180 --> 00:17:28.450
You talk pretty, but aren't you just running away?

00:17:28.450 --> 00:17:33.090
Didn't you face Layla Hamilton
with all your might?

00:17:33.090 --> 00:17:35.060
Why don't you do the same for this guy?

00:17:35.060 --> 00:17:36.490
Because...

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:38.960
If you stay like this, your path will stay blocked.

00:17:38.960 --> 00:17:42.050
You're the only one who can
cut your way through it.

00:17:42.400 --> 00:17:43.890
Get it together!

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:45.900
Yes.

00:17:45.900 --> 00:17:47.990
Thank you very much.

00:17:55.940 --> 00:18:00.050
It's true. I was facing to
Miss Layla like a daredevil.

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:02.950
But I don't have confidence to
act the same to Mr. Leon.

00:18:02.950 --> 00:18:04.790
How on Earth can l...

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:06.850
First of all, I don't like his attitude!

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:07.690
That's right!

00:18:07.690 --> 00:18:09.820
But, if you ask who else could play his role...

00:18:09.820 --> 00:18:11.030
There is nobody.

00:18:11.030 --> 00:18:11.990
That's true.

00:18:11.990 --> 00:18:14.860
If we want to have an eye on
winning in the festival...

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:16.330
Why can't Sora do it by herself?

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:17.030
Yeah!

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:20.000
Unfortunately, the rule is that
she has to be in a pair.

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:21.170
Aw...

00:18:21.170 --> 00:18:22.400
That guy...

00:18:22.400 --> 00:18:24.770
Just watch, I'll do all of his
maneuvers easily in three years.

00:18:26.010 --> 00:18:27.810
Go, Rosetta!

00:18:27.810 --> 00:18:31.780
Excuse me, but I asked everybody to gather
today because I wanted encourage Sora.

00:18:31.780 --> 00:18:33.910
So, if you encourage someone, could
you please encourage Sora?

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:35.650
Oh... That's okay.

00:18:35.650 --> 00:18:38.520
I'm more than thankful the way
all of you care about me.

00:18:38.520 --> 00:18:42.920
The rest of this is my own problem. Really...

00:18:42.920 --> 00:18:47.130
Then, for Sora, I'll show you amazing martial arts
which can't even be drawn by human hands!

00:18:47.130 --> 00:18:47.800
No, that's not necessary...

00:18:47.800 --> 00:18:48.630
Um...y...

00:18:47.800 --> 00:18:48.630
No, that's not necessary...

00:18:48.630 --> 00:18:49.600
Here I go!

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:52.370
You're right! It's amazing!

00:18:52.370 --> 00:18:54.200
She's right. This certainly couldn't
be drawn by human hands.

00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:56.170
Sora, was it helpful?

00:18:56.170 --> 00:18:57.600
Oh, well... kind of...

00:19:03.010 --> 00:19:06.550
Since nobody is in, the air is cool.

00:19:06.550 --> 00:19:11.120
That's right, the cool space where
I'm alone is where I belong.

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:14.820
After I joined Kaleido Stage I decided that.

00:19:15.160 --> 00:19:16.960
In order for someone like me
who just joined Kaleido Stage

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:20.690
to bring down a top star like Sora
even one minute or one second faster,

00:19:20.690 --> 00:19:24.890
I could not afford to goof around
with those others.

00:19:27.940 --> 00:19:29.800
If they don't like me, they can just not like me.

00:19:29.800 --> 00:19:31.740
If they hate me, they can just hate me.

00:19:31.740 --> 00:19:34.440
I'm going to win by all means!

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:39.710
The movement that time...

00:19:40.210 --> 00:19:42.220
Because he didn't have both hands on the bar,

00:19:42.220 --> 00:19:43.880
that's why he was able to do
that kind of unexpected move.

00:19:43.880 --> 00:19:46.110
If I can use that move and
create a new maneuver...

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:55.350
One more time...

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:58.260
I will perfect this maneuver by all means.

00:19:58.670 --> 00:20:02.190
I have no other path forward.

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:15.280
In order to surpass Miss Layla,

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:17.820
and also in order to be a real Kaleido Star,

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:20.450
I want to participate in the
Circus Festival no matter what.

00:20:20.450 --> 00:20:22.750
I want to! I want to!

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:28.200
But, I still don't know what I should do

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:31.430
even though May already found something
and started running toward it.

00:20:37.370 --> 00:20:40.070
Taurus found its way out from the darkness.

00:20:40.070 --> 00:20:44.240
However, Sagittarius is still
engulfed in the darkness.

00:20:45.580 --> 00:20:50.550
Sora, if you exert yourself haphazardly,
you'll just spin in place.

00:20:50.550 --> 00:20:54.680
Then tell me what I'm supposed to do.

00:21:04.670 --> 00:21:07.230
Oh, here she is. Sora!

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:09.340
Oh, Rosetta, good morning.

00:21:09.340 --> 00:21:12.240
This is no time to be exchanging
laid-back small talk!

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:14.710
May said she's going to challenge Leon again.

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:17.230
What?! She did?

00:21:21.050 --> 00:21:25.490
Who knew you'd be the one to ask me
for another challenge.

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:31.450
So, this new maneuver is supposed
to be able to satisfy me?

00:21:33.090 --> 00:21:35.000
Of course it will, Leon.

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:39.230
You're the only one who can
catch my Demon Spiral.

00:21:39.230 --> 00:21:42.500
If you screw up, I will fall.

00:21:42.500 --> 00:21:46.310
If you're the God of Death, I'll be a devil!

00:21:46.310 --> 00:21:50.070
Demon Spiral is a challenge from
a devil to the God of Death!

00:21:51.350 --> 00:21:53.110
I expect you to accept my challenge.

00:22:00.290 --> 00:22:01.880
Here I go.

00:22:11.100 --> 00:22:15.130
That's right. This is my duel with fate!

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:19.570
Demon Spiral!

00:22:26.210 --> 00:22:28.840
Amazing!

