00:23:40.820 --> 00:23:43.120
Next Kaleido Star: New Wings

00:23:43.590 --> 00:23:45.790
When I was at Kaleido Stage,

00:23:45.790 --> 00:23:48.460
I don't think I looked at
the audience's faces much.

00:23:48.460 --> 00:23:51.400
And so, the Demon Spiral was amazing.

00:23:51.400 --> 00:23:54.330
But no, I can't back down like this.

00:23:54.330 --> 00:23:56.670
Being bad at giving up is something I patented!

00:23:56.670 --> 00:23:58.070
If it's with him...

00:23:58.070 --> 00:24:00.370
All right! I will show them what
I'm like when I'm serious too!

00:24:00.370 --> 00:24:02.180
I'll show them! I'll show them!

